	<!-- ************* degradation of  DAG by DAG kinase -->
     <!--  Dag   + DagK <-> DagKdag -> PA  step 1  (Km = 2 mol% Shulga et al. FEBS letters 
Change to Gallimore's values: almost no Dag left (I guess he needed that high Km not to have too high basal active PKC
Change to original Avrama's values
-->
